WEBVTT

00:22:28.798 --> 00:22:31.289
and I always used to dress up for that.

00:22:31.313 --> 00:22:33.323
And I was meeting a friend for lunch

00:22:33.347 --> 00:22:36.828
and I had on a Yohji Yamamoto suit,

00:22:36.852 --> 00:22:41.512
and a couple of photographers
started taking my picture

00:22:41.536 --> 00:22:45.282
and then a bunch of other
photographers saw them do it

00:22:45.306 --> 00:22:46.965
so they came over,

00:22:46.989 --> 00:22:51.092
and my friend was making a joke like,

00:22:51.116 --> 00:22:53.475
"You're an accidental icon."

00:22:53.499 --> 00:22:55.999
AG: If you're going to experiment
with something new,

00:22:56.023 --> 00:22:58.388
it helps to fully immerse
yourself in that world.

00:22:58.412 --> 00:23:00.920
Lyn was creative in where
she looked for her mentors.